11:Participants  were  recruited  by  the  Department  of  Psychiatry  in Affiliated  Brain Hospital  of  Nanjing  Medical  University  (NBH)  and  Nanjing  Drum Tower  Hospital (NDTH) between September 2011 and December 2020. According to the DSM (4 th Edition), all depression patients were diagnosed by at least two attending doctors and assessed  by  the  Hamilton  Rating  Scale  for  Depression  17-item  (HAMD-17)  for depression severity. HCs were recruited from these two local communities, respectively. The  recruitment  and  exclusion  criteria  for  patients  and  HCs  were  detailed  in Supplemental  Methods.  Participants  with  incomplete  clinical  data  or  poor  imaging quality were also excluded. Ultimately, 127 depressed patients and 110 HCs in NBH were enrolled in this study as the discovery cohort. In addition, 60 patients and 56 HCs in  NDTH  were  used  as  an  external  test  set  to  evaluate  the  performance  and generalization of our classification model.
